  "description": "Roll over difficult terrain with ease on the Argus Trail 26 fat tire bike by Mongoose. This beast of a bike provides improved stability on sand, snow, or even slick roads. And the Argus' Tectonic T2 aluminum frame with rigid fork makes for a strong, stable ride with added lateral rigidity.\nThe Argus Trail 26 is a super fun, hardtail fat bike perfect for riding a variety of terrain from snow to sand. Suggested rider height by size: SM: 5'4\" – 5'6\", MD: 5'5\" – 5'10\", LG: 5'9\" – 6'2.\nDurable, lightweight Tectonic T1 aluminum hardtail frame and rigid fork provide strength without sacrificing performance.\nShimano Rapid Fire 2 x 8 shifters and derailleurs provide a wide gear range for climbing dunes or snow-covered trails.\nOversized 4\" knobby MTB tires on 26\" wheels with mechanical disc brakes provide excellent stopping power and tons of traction in sand and snow.",
